Usage: codex [OPTIONS] [PROMPT]
       codex [OPTIONS] <COMMAND> [ARGS]

Commands:
  exec [options] [<prompt>]     Execute a prompt
  review [options]              Run a code review
  resume [options] [session]    Resume an interactive session
  fork [options] [session]      Fork an interactive session
  completion [shell]            Generate shell completion script
  features <list|enable|disable> Inspect feature flags
  app-server                    Start the app server
  config <show|get|set>        Manage configuration
  login [status]               Show login status
  login --with-api-key         Login with API key from stdin
  logout                       Log out

Arguments:
  [PROMPT]                     Optional user prompt to start the session

Options:
  --model, -m <name>           Set the model name
  --cwd, -C, --cd <path>       Set working directory
  --profile, -p <name>         Set profile name
  --config, -c <key=val>       Set config override
  --color <auto|always|never>  Set color mode
  --json                       Enable JSON output
  --ask-for-approval, -a <mode> Configure command approval policy
  --search                     Enable live web search
  --no-alt-screen              Disable alternate screen mode
  --dangerously-bypass-approvals-and-sandbox  Disable approval and sandbox protections
  --resume [session-id]        Resume a session
  --skip-git-repo-check        Skip git repo check
  --help, -h                   Show this help
